#: ../../source/docs/common-rcmap.rst:5 372dfe43396d441fbc21d0b5752f4698
msgid "RC Input Channel Mapping (RCMAP)"
msgstr "RC 输入通道映射（RCMAP）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rcmap.rst:7 c6dd4e65a10f4d9384607879e28f2a38
msgid ""
"This article shows how to set up a non-standard RC input channel mapping "
"using the RCMAP feature."
msgstr "本文介绍如何使用 RCMAP 功能设置非标准 RC 输入通道映射。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rcmap.rst:11 8558f2128cba4b3b9a348b71be57d903
msgid "Configuration"
msgstr "配置"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rcmap.rst:13 928bc244f57543379df0c2f93d4eb307
msgid "By default the RC input channels are:"
msgstr "默认情况下，RC 输入通道为："

#: ../../source/docs/common-rcmap.rst:16 19caeda6a5ff44378198b5068eee9bab
msgid "Channel 1: Roll input"
msgstr "通道1：横滚输入"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rcmap.rst:17 fa14621a1d0141ab950bcf2a17514312
msgid "Channel 2: Pitch input"
msgstr "通道2：俯仰输入"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rcmap.rst:18 9666d421b1d946cfbced9a2911bd55d3
msgid "Channel 3: Throttle input"
msgstr "通道3：油门输入"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rcmap.rst:19 c88356b467bf47fc900b50641c3db295
msgid "Channel 4: Yaw input"
msgstr "通道4：偏航输入"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rcmap.rst:22 124a808159424766b875dfa5840b9811
msgid ""
"These can be changed by setting the  :ref:`RCMAP_ROLL <RCMAP_ROLL>`, "
":ref:`RCMAP_PITCH <RCMAP_PITCH>`, :ref:`RCMAP_THROTTLE <RCMAP_THROTTLE>` and"
" :ref:`RCMAP_YAW <RCMAP_YAW>` parameters using the *Mission Planner*'s "
"**Config/Tuning \\| Full Parameter Tree** (or Full Parameter List) as shown "
"below."
msgstr ""
"可通过使用 *Mission Planner* 的 **Config/Tuning \\| Full Parameter Tree** （或 Full "
"Parameter List）设置 :ref:`RCMAP_ROLL <RCMAP_ROLL>`、:ref:`RCMAP_PITCH "
"<RCMAP_PITCH>`、:ref:`RCMAP_THROTTLE <RCMAP_THROTTLE>` 和 :ref:`RCMAP_YAW "
"<RCMAP_YAW>` 参数来更改这些映射，如下所示。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rcmap.rst:27 218bb7d323334ca0a7dbfb5ae82f347e
msgid ""
"After changing any of these parameters the autopilot should be rebooted."
msgstr "修改上述任何参数后，应重启飞控。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rcmap.rst:31 fde01e8f7f664b29b38366f7ecd26b46
msgid ""
"For multicopters, the :ref:`RC calibration <common-radio-control-"
"calibration>` and :ref:`ESC calibration <copter:esc-calibration>` should be "
"re-done."
msgstr ""
"对于多旋翼飞行器，应重新执行 :ref:`RC 校准 <common-radio-control-calibration>` 和 :ref:`ESC "
"校准 <copter:esc-calibration>`。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rcmap.rst:35 08cb55dd70f04070a3d36dddc906e273
msgid ""
"Additional information about the ``RCMAP`` parameters can be found in the "
":ref:`Parameters <copter:RCMAP_ROLL>` reference."
msgstr "有关 ``RCMAP`` 参数的更多信息，请参阅 :ref:`参数 <copter:RCMAP_ROLL>` 参考。"
